{{#> layout title="Claim under review" preheader="We're reviewing your claim - usually 1-2 business days."}}
  <p class="eyebrow">Claim submitted</p>
  <h1>Your claim is <span class="brush">under review</span></h1>
  {{> greeting}}
  <p>Thanks for claiming <strong>{{businessName}}</strong> on Omnicassion. Your claim is in and our team is taking a look.</p>
  <div class="callout callout-warning">
    <p><strong>What happens next?</strong></p>
    <p>We review your claim and supporting documents, which typically takes 1-2 business days. We'll email you as soon as there's a decision.</p>
  </div>
  <h3>While you wait</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>Check your claim status from your account</li>
    <li>Gather your business information and portfolio</li>
    <li>Read through our vendor guidelines</li>
  </ul>
  {{#if dashboardUrl}}{{> button url=dashboardUrl label="Check claim status"}}{{/if}}
{{/layout}}
